  "description": "Offer-admission vectors. Run admit(manifest, installed_revision) -- the check a device performs on plugin.offer, BEFORE sending plugin.fetch and before any payload chunk moves. An 'admit' case must pass; a 'refuse' case must refuse with the given code and no fetch may be sent. installed_revision is the revision currently installed for this manifest's name, or 0 if none is. Admission neither sees nor needs the payload, which is exactly what distinguishes it from the verify gate.",
  "protocol_version": 2,
  "vectors_version": 1
}
